  "body": "https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#document-open-steps creates the settings object in step 17, which snapshots the then-current document URL as the creation URL.\r\n\r\nThen in step 23 it mutates the document URL.\r\n\r\nThis seems broken.  Consider calling open() multiple times, from different entry settings.  Each time the settings object will end up with the url of the _previous_ open call's entry settings, and the document will end up with the URL of the _this_ call's entry settings...",
